    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Stunning Lyric Videos with Ease \u2013 No Hassle, Just Results</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a game-changer! Lyric Video Studio is designed to make lyric video creation as effortless as hitting that perfect riff on stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With user-friendly text tools and a seamless lyric import feature, you\u2019ll be able to import your lyrics and sync them to your song in no time. Whether you\u2019re a seasoned pro or just getting started, this app is here to make lyric video creation fast, fun, and frustration-free. And yes, we\u2019re sure you know the lyrics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Subscriptions, No Annual Fees \u2013 Just One Purchase, Get Updated</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say goodbye to the endless cycle of paying for annual licenses or buying new versions of the app each year. Buy once, and you\u2019ll get free updates, just like the good old days. We\u2019ll keep the app fresh with new features and new plugins added regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Limitless Creativity with 3rd Party Plugin Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your lyric videos to the next level! Our app supports 3rd party plugins, giving you  possibilities to enhance your videos with unique image and video effects and generated content.  Visit our homepage for more details on how to get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to bring your music to life in a way that\u2019s simple, powerful, and all your own. Stay tuned for the official release!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Stunning Lyric Videos with Ease \u2013 No Hassle, Just Results</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a game-changer! Lyric Video Studio is designed to make lyric video creation as effortless as hitting that perfect riff on stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With user-friendly text tools and a seamless lyric import feature, you\u2019ll be able to import your lyrics and sync them to your song in no time. Whether you\u2019re a seasoned pro or just getting started, this app is here to make lyric video creation fast, fun, and frustration-free. And yes, we\u2019re sure you know the lyrics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Subscriptions, No Annual Fees \u2013 Just One Purchase, Get Updated</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say goodbye to the endless cycle of paying for annual licenses or buying new versions of the app each year. Buy once, and you\u2019ll get free updates, just like the good old days. We\u2019ll keep the app fresh with new features and new plugins added regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Limitless Creativity with 3rd Party Plugin Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your lyric videos to the next level! Our app supports 3rd party plugins, giving you  possibilities to enhance your videos with unique image and video effects and generated content.  Visit our homepage for more details on how to get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to bring your music to life in a way that\u2019s simple, powerful, and all your own. Stay tuned for the official release!</p>",
    "short_description": "Lyric video creation made easy with simple text tools and 3rd party plugin support. Create lyric videos, visualizers, music videos or simply finalize you videos by adding subtitles",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Finnish",
